---
import Layout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/family-app-brand.css';
import AppKitLibrary from '../../components/AppKitLibrary';

---
<Layout title="Club" description="Monthly family tools and kit previews.">
<div class="family-brand mx-auto max-w-4xl">
<header><p class="label text-[#71866c]">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB</p><h1 class="family-title mt-4">One small win <em>each month.</em></h1><p class="family-lede mt-4">Practical, prepared tools that help everyone share the work. This is a preview library, not an active membership.</p></header>
<section class="family-feature mt-9"><span class="family-preview-pill">FEATURED PREVIEW · OCTOBER</span><h2 class="family-panel-title mt-5">Our Family Sunday Reset</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">A simple Sunday rhythm to check the calendar, prepare for the week, and share responsibilities before Monday arrives.</p><a href="/app/club/october/" class="family-action mt-6">Preview the Sunday Reset →</a><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">Opens the mobile preview with the existing printable. No order or mailing is created.</p></section>
<section class="family-feature mt-6"><span class="family-preview-pill">PREVIEW · JANUARY</span><h2 class="family-panel-title mt-5">Our Family Habit Cards</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">One or two small cards, placed where the habit happens, so the kids know what to do next without another reminder.</p><a href="/app/club/january/" class="family-action mt-6">Preview the Habit Cards →</a><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">Opens the mobile preview with the existing printable. No order or mailing is created.</p></section>
<section class="mt-10"><h2 class="family-panel-title">Monthly kit library</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-warm-soft">From the existing Club kit catalog. Future and draft kits are shown for review, not as purchased items.</p><AppKitLibrary client:only="react" /></section>
</div>
</Layout>